      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2012 Elsevier Ireland Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We followed 1372 prediabetic individuals aged ≥ 20 years and documented 278 incident diabetes cases. Family history of diabetes, blood pressure, waist, high-density lipoprotein cholesterol, and FPG independently associated with diabetes progression among women. Among men, family history of premature CVD, waist, and FPG remained independently associated with diabetes progression."
      },
